{"inkVersion":21,"root":[["#","^speaker:Manager ","/#","#","^background:Street","/#","^......","\n","#","^speaker:Manager","/#","^今天要去新的公司...","\n","#","^speaker:Manager","/#","^有點緊張呢，已經三年沒正式工作了","\n","#","^speaker:Manager","/#","^上一份工作...","\n","#","^speaker:Manager ","/#","#","^background:NormalStage","/#","^...","\n","#","^speaker:Manager","/#","^（——自從那次被炒之後）","\n","#","^speaker:Manager","/#","^（不只遞出的履歷全都沒有消息，身邊還出現了奇怪的東西）","\n","#","^speaker:Manager ","/#","#","^background:Street","/#","#","^font:Shake","/#","^（別想了!）","\n","#","^speaker:Manager","/#","^這三年都靠著兼職艱難地撐過，好不容易有公司願意雇用我，一定要好好努力","\n","#","^speaker:Manager","/#","^雖然環境好像不怎麼好就是了...","\n","#","^speaker:Empty ","/#","#","^background:Office","/#","#","^sfx:knock","/#","^(叩叩)","\n","#","^speaker:Boss ","/#","#","^background:Office ","/#","#","^font:Big ","/#","#","^font:Bold","/#","^請進!!!!!!!!!!!!!","\n","#","^speaker:Boss ","/#","#","^background:Office ","/#","#","^font:Normal","/#","^你好呀新來的!正式向你自我介紹，我是這間小小事務所「Star Sprout」的老闆，請多多指教！","\n","#","^speaker:Manager","/#","^(這個老闆...好不靠譜的感覺...)","\n","#","^speaker:Boss","/#","^那麼馬上進入正題，你還記得我們之前談好的工作內容吧，知道那個節目的名稱嗎？","\n","#","^speaker:Manager","/#","ev","str","^...NEO Polaris?","/str","/ev",{"*":"0.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^...IDOL PACT?","/str","/ev",{"*":"0.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^...FIRERA?","/str","/ev",{"*":"0.c-2","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n",{"->":"NEOPOLARIS"},{"->":"0.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n",{"->":"IDOLPACT"},{"->":"0.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n",{"->":"FIRERA"},{"->":"0.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"g-0":["done",{"#f":5}]}],"done",{"NEOPOLARIS":["#","^speaker:Boss","/#","^沒錯，NEO Polaris，那個世界級的偶像徵選企劃。","\n",{"->":"Main"},{"#f":1}],"IDOLPACT":["#","^speaker:Boss","/#","^嗯......我是這麼說的嗎？哈哈哈，可能是我記錯了。但IDOL PACT這名字聽起來就不會紅","\n","#","^speaker:Boss","/#","^咳咳，我們回到正題","\n",{"->":"Main"},{"#f":1}],"FIRERA":["#","^speaker:Boss","/#","^嗯......我是這麼說的嗎？哈哈哈，可能是我記錯了。但FIRERA這名字聽起來就不會紅","\n","#","^speaker:Boss","/#","^咳咳，我們回到正題","\n",{"->":"Main"},{"#f":1}],"Main":["#","^speaker:Boss",